Real simv.daidir/vcs_rebuild files from four small VCS W-2024.09 compiles of one design (module tb with
an instance u_fifo of a module with parameter DEPTH), each run in its own folder with ../t.sv:
  none     no override
  ffile    -f ../opts.f, which holds -pvalue+tb.u_fifo.DEPTH=32
  cmdline  -pvalue+tb.u_fifo.DEPTH=8 given through a shell variable (VCS records it expanded)
  plus     +pvalue+tb.u_fifo.DEPTH=4 (VCS accepted this spelling: exit 0)
